{
  "scope": "Post-hoc regrouping of the same four already studied LOSO development sites. The two crossed-road locations, one park and one street do not separately identify the effect of scene type, country, geometry, camera or traffic. Park and street labels describe acquisition sites; lane marking visibility has not been coded for each window.",
  "source_paper": "https://arxiv.org/html/2605.25947v1",
  "source_section": "Figures 7 and 8 (a\u2013d) and surrounding discussion.",
  "units": "Fitted ground coordinates in metres; five real 10 Hz observations, complete 30-step 3s forecast. All trajectories scored by probability-selected mode; deterministic CV uses the last two ground points. People counts refer to (clip, person ID) tracks. Person identities across videos are not linked.",
  "aggregation": "Mean windows within site. Equal site weights within each specified group. For existing M0/M1 first average the five fixed training seeds per window. Joint arms use a separate seed-42 individual-only experiment, with common motion/pose backbone. The no_head joint control is not the existing motion-only M0.",
  "uncertainty": {
    "draws": 20000,
    "rng_seed": 2026,
    "method": "Sample whole clips with replacement within each fixed site; identical draws across methods and metrics. Paired contrasts positive when first named method has larger error; point and percentile interval conditional on these fitted models, same fixed sites and test windows. No correction across descriptive comparisons."
  },
